      },
      {
        "text": "For how knoweth a man the master whom he has not served, and who is a stranger unto him, and is far from the thoughts and intents of his heart?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "Jer. 4:22; Mosiah 26:25 (24–27)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
